// depth from three 8-bit channels of a depth surface sampled through a colour
// sampler (`* 255 + 0.5`, `floor`, then a dp3 against {2^-24, 2^-8, 2^-16}). On
// the PC backend the post-fx targets' depth is bound as a RAW-DEPTH texture
// (INTZ / DF24 / DF16), which returns the depth value in .r at full precision,
// so those three instructions collapse to a single fetch. Same quantity,
